age state, and only normal reboot-generated temporary-directory changes.","evidence_ids":["cmd-de559543753a4ba4","cmd-9d5b1c2702cd49d1","cmd-ec44303a3f6f48ad","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The independent restart protocol is also complete: it records a healthy pre-restart state, restart acknowledgement, a changed boot identity corroborated by lifecycle snapshots, and recovered sshd, pinned-key configuration, account data, and SSH login.","limitations":[]}
